<title>NEW ZEALAND: ANZ, Postbank cut two and three yr mortgage rates.</title>
<headline>ANZ, Postbank cut two and three yr mortgage rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ Bank and Postbank said on Friday they had cut their fixed two and three year mortgage lending rates to 8.50 percent from 8.75 percent effective on Monday.</p>
<p>Other fixed and the variable rate were left unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
